---
title: "decryptSealedBid (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_published: resultsPublished == true (private key available)
    q_check_published --> q_load_key: load released privateKey
    q_load_key --> q_decrypt: decrypt(encryptedAmountOut, salt, privateKey)
    q_decrypt --> q_return: return decrypted bid amount
    q_return --> [*]: return plaintext amount

    q_check_published --> q_revert: results not yet published
    q_revert --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished

    note right of q_decrypt
        INV-001: decryption uses ECIES with released private key
        INV-002: salt must equal investor address as uint256 for valid decryption
        INV-003: anyone can call after private key release (public verification)
    end note
